    },
    {
      "id": "09ea62ae6d33182a92301e43f0c43c11ee29d2fcedcb815b067bb4a43da3a965",
      "text": "Attention degradation",
      "hash": "892a19ca52d75c31194b0b4d50bdbdc67fcce95b1420c662633dbdda562252f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "0a5b95e346f1f40541ea43e9e27f5f64e408a27264eb74a69a63619b1a33eb4e",
      "text": "As a session grows, each token's attention budget spreads across more competitors; signal on meaningful relationships shrinks.",
      "hash": "af10f843a07adbc1fdcb1f1d6b683a2c001d57d331382c97d0265434878784c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "c32689db09754efc8191983d0464c1a6454dded21a4a767999eff13b3f54bafd",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "85fb2ee065a0a28498c036781f0e463aa1ece21cae8f684da6d2d0574f927acb",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "0e8d13e5bc785da0046b9c8f70f37ab012a6ac585f59d0ab44149f7b099954bd",
      "text": "As a",
      "hash": "7fb457ae301b009ee3c88580b9fb48352bf172afb27fd24ee53b4f4f46b09a08"
    },
    {
      "id": "7b58f9e1e90ce221b763ff3c321d56421d656b60d87c8bce4678f64bfc16bd58",
      "text": "grows, each",
      "hash": "63c13d5bb60daeadf45316adc2484463ee1e3d03174dbdccf5dadc74e6fd7286"
    },
    {
      "id": "73babb67ff6e9463b7bc653d507eef08716e4cea287b07b99362f9cb30e736d8",
      "text": "'s",
      "hash": "edc00d4db80ddc3e91783b63ae5fbcdfd204de983c650e9587785a40271c8f3c"
    },
    {
      "id": "70f0d73cc1335d5782686bd1d0e52a1939fbebecf8819ff0e506f07fb02df278",
      "text": "attention budget",
      "hash": "4f0ecd6ea97f18771cbd4203a929018449d8dbd4c6cce6f90fd7511b5c34cc81"
    },
    {
      "id": "f61fab99ff05a353498f36e285ba0dc5e4946029a17633632540be22ccee7ae9",
      "text": "is spread across more competitors. The signal on any one",
      "hash": "e102c415386125270389f0d21e9d0f13476b46c82eda6a3e8c3925779a3a4c90"
    },
    {
      "id": "c99de51d75e5c722b8156aeb0a55923688e7c48ef7ca1e3ffc9f7c662504dd16",
      "text": "meaningful relationship",
      "hash": "8dfe0d2c8add8488e5c965e07a14afac96b8df8cce7b778696c24e5137b249dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "b5a3976c501353e594a8c22371ae586ce9bf797cc3d9ffb520d1459c17f08ca7",
      "text": "shrinks; noise from irrelevant",
      "hash": "6890df6ae821096672eca53dfd4031e6df7eb5862452fd6069afcf050fbfe329"
    },
    {
      "id": "7371d351a0bba49d67bd3a156bd1b7b5cd1340d4f08742adac8fe1a4a9fb844a",
      "text": "crowds in. Same",
      "hash": "e1f157ada492146b9292e41e2b472a31c23c370ec5fce56fe5ccdf5db84f05e3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c8dfe80473bf637ed4c3e4e1b27500760f7647541db87bbba1e6181744412995",
      "text": ", same",
      "hash": "8cd0e690b9495085fdfcb2e08e72b1bfe0e3257c2daf868c2ca49ee891f61fdd"
    },
    {
      "id": "7112883d1ab092b6d1ddfc9181d9b520a4d2f006cae5122b37d24cd2424cba63",
      "text": "— just more mouths to feed from the same plate. Cause of the smart zone / dumb",
      "hash": "6c781a0374fdb6d151c46dd4bbee5e842ab9d95e21eb314805b649ab2ed14be5"
    },
    {
      "id": "6efdf18540ce7b0c2c3dd26c6a0e5e07e822adc7d2ac4f305dc8adfc89f78555",
      "text": "zone effect",
      "hash": "c9a02753a67a47e99a0296b92f3dc3281338adb198c006a38619c4435efc8d92"
    },
    {
      "id": "5ba923c2cb40a6962615d050705a55f993637f66a2e8bf375fbe5078706ff045",
      "text": "It presents as the model getting worse mid-session: constraints it followed for an hour start slipping, it re-asks things it was told, it writes code that ignores a file it read earlier. Nothing about the model changed — the only variable is how much context it's now attending over.",
      "hash": "d7e9dd8a42c2082c742dce7fadaa6bf4169618564630459fd27afdbaeec73f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "582a3ca342aa6975a05c2ea52e1eb2035ef82147e95575639fc3c2ddb36b4237",
      "text": "It's gradual, which is what makes it hard to catch from inside the session. There's no error and no threshold; each",
      "hash": "bb2f24bfb5bbeb9d715dcbbb2880e684adc1e7faa78349a33c89148f4e3d6cb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "322018faa1623bdd8395346d1274cc2622766c1922f3eef36c1284f25706cd0b",
      "text": "is only slightly worse than the last, and by the time the slips are obvious you've been in the dumb zone for a while.",
      "hash": "982fb786da9eb40530128374ae357feb5fd871942e36a5cda2c37c59e31055d4"
    },
    {
      "id": "60c17434deca7adbb6c43e12363fbd7a95ca55a5f7ad5c2b80e43fc0c9631ac4",
      "text": "You recover by removing context, not adding more. Re-pasting the ignored instruction adds another competitor to the same crowded window and helps only briefly. What works:",
      "hash": "ad633e3a77c48671263d4819c103826735b208e7f11db5c4e741e5a6040269e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c76e3f7473f74856b7c015382ee01bb9045b5ad8db15bd0eee092c5dd90dcb2",
      "text": "and reload only what the task needs, or",
      "hash": "9291871b10791363aeb7d44787320a2511d4bae5c6241150757f49e0ca19f85b"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6e6a54dd29dcb4fec392f6652c3678627f31600c535d0a444e1493e4340e8fd",
      "text": ", or",
      "hash": "3d30020b1863441a64e786bdc72745e998a1e3abd32100e1b043bfa7a01b9095"
    },
    {
      "id": "41b13255b028bfc9b7fb2172edc1f38f84a95dbf99da259aa6627fa310c9004f",
      "text": "hand off",
      "hash": "788b26357616f05b942de01ef730af4ca32e9af141783ec6be65e812ed323ec3"
    },
    {
      "id": "342d48c09230f11bc00e1186d8f246ff16dcbb9169cbd3fab8281409c07f6865",
      "text": "to a fresh session. Treat declining instruction-following as a signal about context length, not about the model.",
      "hash": "4a347a8b30e23de18edb482e9d68e7408ab6875cd4ea638a82caeadf0e191535"
    },
    {
      "id": "d766b17eb855d9c71da089c8ef8130f415d11cd793accc4b11bffd482454ad99",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "2bacc606a5cd854d4113493c034f1fa2bea5ce35fa62a11b6fa1a631eb4d40c0",
      "text": "\"It's deep in the dumb zone — inventing generics that aren't in the type file.\"",
      "hash": "bcd69df540b99e4fc1a2e49237d49093af27a8cf921d0d05d9f702f1723ea2e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "27cef4a15a7fe7937ca17d70f7ad2e2809921c60a28d0cd36ac655a4240ddaf9",
      "text": "\"Attention degradation. The type definitions are still in context, but the signal on them is buried under everything we've added since. Clear and reload.\"",
      "hash": "9e2ef988d7ac193c0b9e5fa18a31eed531b0b853bb6b60a5baa061f94622e0fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "46cee1c877e6afba673a231684af47b33fbc6de2fce02a8dfef1597ab5111d43",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "6fe979a7da675609bc4453c05831219385ca59cc268a5a3edf460a7c29a98caa",
      "text": "Attention budget",
      "hash": "3050c3ed0aa7f513c8d6d6891433e8d97ad0fbe382486b1f5b52a1129c834ab1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2c62b3e9b96e91c2e828fe6bb6fbcb47d5eb61ad2897136a78e5c4f4214449ae",
